          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-do-ni-yaa kɛnɛ ja̱a̱l tin te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ ɛ liŋ kɛn diaal min cikɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ mi̱eth. Kä min ci Yo-ab jɔw kaaŋä liŋ, cuɛ wëë, “Ɛŋu mi lot rɔal ɛ mɔ jɛ rɛy wec?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ŋotdɛ kɛ ruac, nɛnɛ cu Jo-na-than gat Ɛb-ya-thar bo̱o̱th palä ben. Kä cu Ä-do-ni-yaa wëë, “Bër rɛc, kɛ ɣöö ɛ ji̱n ram mi gɔaa, kä la no̱o̱ŋi thuk ti gɔw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-na-than Ä-do-ni-yaa loc i̱, “Eey, /ciɛ jɛn, ɛ ɣöö ci kuääran ni Dee-bid Thɔ-lo-mon kuany ala kuäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci kuäär bo̱o̱th palä ni Dha-dok, kɛnɛ gök ni Na-than, kɛ Bɛ-na-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da, kɛ ji̱ Kɛ-reth kɛnɛ ji̱ Pɛ-lɛth ja̱k kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. Kä cikɛ jɛ jak kä ko̱tdɛ jɔk muɔ̱l kua̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci bo̱o̱th palä ni Dha-dok, kɛnɛ gök ni Na-than jɛ Yi̱r ala kuäär kä Gii-ɣɔn. Kä ci lɔcdiɛn cu tɛɛth ɛn wi̱ni, ɛ jɛn rɔal kɛ wec ɔ. Ɛ jɛn rɔal in cia liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Thɔ-lo-mon nyuur wi̱i̱ kɔam kuäärä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci ji̱ kɔaar kua̱r ni Dee-bid ben latkɛ tɛth lɔaacdiɛn, wäkɛ i̱, ‘Bi Kuɔthdu kɛ̈k Thɔ-lo-mon jak kä jɔc ni jɛn kä kɛ̈kdu, kä bɛ kuäärɛ jak kä di̱t ni jɛn kä kuääru.’ Kä cu kuäär rɔ goŋ wi̱i̱ dhaŋä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär lɛni wëë, ‘Ɛ puɔ̱th tekɛ Kuoth Nhial, Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl, min ci kuɛ̈ɛ̈dä kɛl jak kä nyuur wi̱i̱ kɔamdä ɛn walɛ, a cä nɛn kɛ waŋdä.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
